The D-Bus introspection files in this directory (Accessible.xml, Action.xml,
Application.xml, Cache.xml, Collection.xml, Component.xml,
DeviceEventController.xml, EditableText.xml, Event.xml, Image.xml,
org.a11y.Bus.xml, Registry.xml, Selection.xml, Socket.xml, Status.xml,
Text.xml, Types.xml, Value.xml) are copied unchanged from Avalonia,
src/Avalonia.FreeDesktop.AtSpi/DBusXml, at commit
d3c867a9e2de379249b03dbeb3495bd7f076a81a. They describe the AT-SPI2
interfaces of at-spi2-core, trimmed by Avalonia to what applications
implement. The av: elements are Avalonia's own generator annotations and are
ignored by Tmds.DBus.Generator.

../AtSpiRole.cs and ../AtSpiState.cs are adapted from the files of the same
names in src/Avalonia.FreeDesktop.AtSpi at the same commit: the namespace is
Waylonia.Accessibility and both enums are public. AtSpiRole adds FontChooser
(22) and renumbers the roles from 80 on to match atspi-constants.h (Avalonia's
copy lacks Chart and Caption and is off from Heading to Timer), and adds the
roles through Switch (130).

